  "summary": "Fixes SerialConsole.run_shell so a failed cd cannot execute any semicolon-separated part of the command. Groups the whole command in braces, validates exit_var as a shell variable identifier, pre-seeds exit_var with a sentinel, and falls back to the body exit status if the command did not set it. Adds a real /bin/sh framing test with a stale ec=0 and a semicolon command that would overwrite a sentinel.",
